sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as API Gateway
    participant Lambda
    participant Stripe
    participant DB as DynamoDB
    participant Email as SES

    User->>Frontend: Select Premium Plan
    Frontend->>API: POST /v1/shop/gems/checkout (JWT)
    API->>Lambda: Forward request
    Lambda->>Stripe: Create checkout session
    Stripe-->>Lambda: Checkout session URL
    Lambda-->>Frontend: Redirect URL
    Frontend->>User: Redirect to Stripe checkout
    User->>Stripe: Complete payment
    Stripe->>User: Redirect to success page
    Stripe->>Lambda: checkout.session.completed webhook
    Lambda->>DB: Credit gems to user account
    Lambda->>Email: Send purchase confirmation
    Email-->>User: Confirmation email
